# SpecSync — Cursor Rules

This project uses **SpecSync** to keep all software design artifacts and source code always
in sync using a team of specialized AI skills.

## When to activate

Only activate when the user's message **explicitly starts with `/ss`**.
Do not activate for any other request.

## Procedure

**Always start by reading:** `.agents/skills/specsync/SKILL.md`

The full workflow, specialist paths, artifact locations, and rules are defined there. Follow them exactly.

